<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>We received your enquiry — Rapid Consulting</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f6f9; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 32px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .header { background: #1a3c5e; padding: 28px 32px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; }
    .header p { margin: 4px 0 0; color: #a8c4e0; font-size: 13px; }
    .body { padding: 28px 32px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .text { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: #444; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .box { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #1a3c5e; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .box p { margin: 4px 0; }
    .box strong { color: #1a3c5e; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fb; padding: 16px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
    .footer a { color: #1a3c5e; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Rapid Consulting</h1>
      <p>Business &amp; Financial Advisory</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Dear <%- name %>,</p>
      <p class="text">
        Thank you for reaching out to Rapid Consulting. We have received your enquiry and
        our team will get back to you shortly.
      </p>
      <div class="box">
        <p><strong>Your enquiry details</strong></p>
        <p>Phone: <%- phone %></p>
        <% if (subject) { %><p>Subject: <%- subject %></p><% } %>
        <% if (requirement) { %><p>Requirement: <%- requirement %></p><% } %>
      </div>
      <p class="text">
        We typically respond within 1 business day. If you have an urgent query,
        please call us directly.
      </p>
      <p class="text">
        Warm regards,<br/>
        <strong>Rapid Consulting Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; Rapid Consulting &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a href="https://rapidconsulting.in">rapidconsulting.in</a><br/>
      You received this because you submitted an enquiry on our website.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
